WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.390
Farmers spread fertiliser
to help their crops grow.

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.470
But when rain washes
some of it into a lake,

3
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.970
the water turns green with algae.

4
00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.470
Then the fish start to die.

5
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.010
So how can something that helps
plants grow end up killing fish?

6
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.550
In this mission, you'll see
how plants take in nitrogen as

7
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.570
nitrates, and how bacteria
and decomposers keep nitrogen

8
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.470
cycling through an ecosystem.

9
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.310
You'll find out what happens when
too much nitrate reaches the

10
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.070
water.

11
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.130
And you'll follow what happens next,

12
00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:35.190
when the algae and plants die.

13
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:39.330
Your mission: explain how
fertiliser can kill the fish in a

14
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.190
lake.
